# Phase 3: Project Design

## Project Name
FitBuddy

## System Architecture

The FitBuddy application consists of three main parts:

1. Frontend
2. Backend
3. Data/Processing Layer

### Frontend
The frontend provides the user interface. Users can enter their fitness information and view their fitness plan.

### Backend
The backend handles user requests and processes the submitted information.

### Data/Processing
The application processes the user's fitness information and generates appropriate recommendations.

## Technology Stack

- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Python with FastAPI
- Development Tool: Visual Studio Code
- Browser: Google Chrome

## Basic Workflow

User
↓
Enter Fitness Details
↓
Submit Information
↓
FastAPI Backend
↓
Process Information
↓
Generate Fitness Plan
↓
Display Result to User

## Main Modules

### User Input Module
Collects the user's fitness details.

### Fitness Processing Module
Processes the information provided by the user.

### Fitness Plan Module
Generates a suitable fitness plan.

### Result Module
Displays the fitness recommendations to the user.
